# Session resume

At the **start of every conversation**, before exploring or implementing:

1. Read `docs/SESSION-HANDOFF.md` if it exists.
2. Treat that file as the exact resume point. Do not skip ahead or reopen checked-off work unless the user asks.
3. Then run `scripts/session-start.ps1` (Windows PowerShell) per `docs/AGENTS.md`.

When the handoff file is missing, fall back to `docs/TODO.md` and `docs/MASTER-TIER-AUDIT.md`.

Never wipe `data/`, `media/`, `log/` (analytics/audit test data), or `backups/` as part of resume, checkpoint, or “fresh install.” Fresh installs run on **bandpromo.site** only. See `.cursor/rules/never-wipe-runtime.mdc`.
